      extraFaq: ["Can you install accessories I bought myself?", "Usually yes, after checking two things: that the parts suit your exact vehicle, and that installation will not disturb systems the part touches. Bring the parts or send their details before the appointment — discovering incompatibility on the lift wastes your booking."]
